+## Current shared-writer batch
+
+The current batch begins at `aa3a685f4725f7b12c2d96be252a77c94097ad12`.
+It adds characterized, shared acquisition and record writing for all three package
+families, APT compatibility delegates and an Arch cache/reporting repair.
+`BUNDLE-WRITER.md` describes preserved behavior and the intentional change.
+Focused, before-fix and static evidence is in `validation/bundle-refactor/`;
+the final complete-corpus result is in `validation/bundle-refactor-gate/`.
+Intermediate failed runs are retained under `validation/bundle-delegation-gate/`
+and `validation/bundle-delegation-gate-rerun/`, with their causes documented.
+
+## Previous build-boundary batch
 
 This batch starts at upstream `b14bf5e0de840269289e5c2e728f1e17e26c39a7`.
 The unmodified source passed 1,341 local tests with no skips or deselections.
